# GitHub Linguist 语言统计规则配置

# 1. 样式文件：将 SCSS 归一为 CSS 并纳入统计
*.scss linguist-language=CSS
*.scss linguist-detectable=true
*.css linguist-language=CSS
*.css linguist-detectable=true

# 2. TypeScript：纳入语言统计
*.ts linguist-language=TypeScript
*.ts linguist-detectable=true

# 3. Markdown：所有 Markdown 文件纳入语言统计（覆盖默认 prose/documentation 排除逻辑）
*.md linguist-language=Markdown
*.md linguist-detectable=true
*.md linguist-documentation=false

# 4. OFL 字体许可证：识别为 OpenType Feature File 字体特性语言
OFL.txt linguist-language=OpenType-Feature-File
OFL.txt linguist-detectable=true
OFL.txt linguist-documentation=false

# 5. 构建产物忽略统计
lib/** linguist-vendored
dist/** linguist-vendored

